---
title: "destroy_zero (Sui Framework: balance)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: check balance.value == 0
    q_validate --> q_abort: balance.value != 0
    q_abort --> [*]: abort ENonZero
    q_validate --> q_destruct: balance.value == 0
    q_destruct --> [*]: Balance destructured and dropped

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: only zero-value balances can be destroyed without supply change
    end note
